Package: gstscope
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Erdem <erdemkkok@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gstreamer-1.0, libgstreamer1.0-0 (>= 1.16), gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-tools
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/erdemkkok/f-gstscobe
Description: GStreamer pipeline profiler and RTSP stream checker
 gstscope traces running GStreamer pipelines (per-element processing time,
 per-link fps/bitrate, queue fill, QoS drops, errors) through a tracer plugin
 and checks RTSP cameras/DVRs (codec, fps, bitrate, GOP, jitter, reconnects).
 Everything is shown in a web UI served from the board.
